EVE Wrench, by Tim Kunze
------------------------
https://github.com/eve-wrench/eve-wrench-app

Used as a guide to what the settings mean. These follow it: which settings
belong to which group when copying, the ready-made probe formations and the
limits on a formation, balancing a formation with a counterweight probe, which
way north, west and up lie in a stored probe position, and the line in
prefs.ini for "always show bracket text".

EVE Wrench's README states that it is under the MIT licence. Its repository
had no licence file of its own when this was written (2026-10-12), so the
standard MIT text is given here, with the author named in its Cargo.toml:

